Usage: mockserver import [-hV] [-H=<host>] -p=<port> <file>
Load expectations from a JSON file into a running MockServer.
      <file>          Path to a JSON file containing a single expectation or an
                        array of expectations.
  -h, --help          Show this help message and exit.
  -H, --host=<host>   Host of the running MockServer (default: localhost).
  -p, --port=<port>   Port of the running MockServer to load the expectations
                        into.
  -V, --version       Print version information and exit.
